9307444_2240712823510402_3376839232672470156_n.png?_nc_cat=109&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ZIXFwAxqcBgQ7kNvwFpwNf7&_nc_oc=AdpbOKomHKA1qHcch9qK8anCqzzrpkR-SHkFysR6PP8RKpqitpDiRxUAS_-Ui4qBPoI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQUTC7t4IAe0iAZ0wLx-XAsBrhW7X8A-bkog0brdpgpFxw&oe=6B0F1634"}, {"file_name": "ZooPrankVR_01_Savanna_SneezeStorm.png", "id": "1453095660339342", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499313058_1453095663672675_8421063851099135688_n.png?_nc_cat=106&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=zb9bQLGuo5wQ7kNvwEO4QBl&_nc_oc=AdoeXVOc_0V7Xui15T_pM6HD54A2VdQTM6AGkZUBIQRnwmftp-6BwphmW4B7dxvZDJQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQWox4a80FcXGwAJ7nKzeb98YB-BIU8gLv8zd7l7PElSeg&oe=6B0F1818"}, {"file_name": "ZooPrankVR_02_Zipline_DynamiteDrop.png", "id": "2592198041278096", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499312231_2592198044611429_5051360367436354825_n.png?_nc_cat=109&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=D_3qPVMS3wUQ7kNvwHU3tPv&_nc_oc=AdpubeybZhvdZeC56o6Cl4chC55BSrW0R35EefHpijg40BgKeRjQUbPMITX2qE29WDI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQVEXG6hq7jJAIA8nsbaD3-YAr_7WwGJLmThbZjoKEqKRQ&oe=6B0F164D"}, {"file_name": "ZooPrankVR_05_HalloweenNight_BroomRide.png", "id": "1424525300746117", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499303445_1424525304079450_6291212757788428376_n.png?_nc_cat=108&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=sr5cfFEPyr4Q7kNvwHV-ddm&_nc_oc=AdrvJRC3yAm4YFlcm4RipysWGL0bzIf_C9oZh9Nng-5n5TUDbGOyXsupI-lYhngvyOM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQV2j1PN8TBCPnXnIkROlZspY8ZpyDlUhCafvYAktzlbbw&oe=6B0EEAD0"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Zoo Prank: Pets Park Simulator", "keywords": ["prank", "zoo", "animals", "pet", "park"], "long_description": "Welcome to the zoo. Please don\u2019t feed the animals. Definitely don\u2019t release them.\n\nZoo Prank: Pets Park Simulator drops you into a sunny theme-park zoo packed with tourists, shopkeepers, and very nervous zookeepers, and hands you a bag full of terrible ideas. Sneak up on visitors, set the perfect trap, then sit back and watch the physics do the rest.\n\nBE THE ZOO\u2019S BIGGEST TROUBLEMAKER\nEvery visitor reacts. Scare them with a jack-in-the-box, blast them with a megaphone, send a wind-up mouse under their feet, or yank their snacks away with a magnet. Pranks earn you laughs, and they also raise the heat.\n\nUNLEASH THE ANIMALS\nMonkeys, elephants, big cats, and more: 12 animals that go wild when you open the gates. Start a rampage and watch the whole park run.\n\nA PRANK BAG FULL OF CHAOS\nSquirt guns, throwables, slingshots, a bow, banana-peel traps, booster shoes, and a flamethrower for when things get serious. Holster tools on your hips, stash more in your over-the-shoulder Prank Bag, and track every prank you\u2019ve pulled in your Prank Journal.\n\nRUN, HIDE, ESCAPE\nPush your luck too far and the zookeepers come after you. Zip across the park on ziplines, bounce off giant mushrooms, slide down slides, jump on a skateboard, or take an arcade car or a tank and leave them in the dust.\n\nA WHOLE PARK TO PLAY IN\nRide the rides, go fishing, spy on your next victim through a telescope, and explore every zone of the zoo. It\u2019s your playground, and nobody can stop you. Well, they can try.\n", "short_description": "You\u2019re the zoo\u2019s worst visitor. Prank tourists, unleash 12 rampaging animals, and outrun the keepers with traps, gadgets, ziplines, and even a tank. A physics sandbox where every prank is a clip waiting to happen."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://hasanswy.wixsite.com/emberpeak/privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Ember Peak ", "support_website_url": 